---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout
  title="About Us — DayBook"
  description="DayBook is an independent, privacy-first online notes and daily to-do list app designed for clarity, focus, and simplicity."
  canonicalPath="/about"
  eyebrow="ABOUT OUR MISSION"
  headline="A calm space for your everyday thinking"
  subtitle="Built for writers, thinkers, planners, and anyone who values clarity over complexity."
  activeNav="about"
>
  <section>
    <h2>Our Story</h2>
    <p>
      In an era dominated by bloated productivity suites that demand monthly subscriptions, require mandatory logins, and monetize your private data, <strong>DayBook</strong> was created with a radically simpler vision: <em>software that gets out of your way</em>.
    </p>
    <p>
      We believe that capturing a spontaneous thought or planning your daily to-do list should take less than a second. No onboarding sequences, no password resets, no synchronization lags. Just an open page, crisp typography, and an interface that respects your attention.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Core Principles</h2>
    <div class="callout-box">
      <h3>1. Privacy by Architecture</h3>
      <p>
        Your personal thoughts, plans, and journal entries are private. DayBook stores all your notes and tasks directly in your browser's local storage (client-side). We do not transmit or store your note text on any external servers. What you write stays on your device.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="callout-box">
      <h3>2. Zero Friction</h3>
      <p>
        You can open DayBook on any device, create a note immediately with <kbd style="padding:2px 6px;border:1px solid #d7d5d8;border-radius:3px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;">N</kbd>, search in milliseconds with <kbd style="padding:2px 6px;border:1px solid #d7d5d8;border-radius:3px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:11px;">⌘ K</kbd>, and organize tasks effortlessly with color-coded labels and priority tags.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="callout-box">
      <h3>3. Progressive Web App (Offline First)</h3>
      <p>
        DayBook is engineered as a modern Progressive Web App (PWA). You can install it on your Mac, Windows PC, iPhone, iPad, or Android phone, and use it anywhere — even without an active internet connection.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Why Free? Advertising Disclosures</h2>
    <p>
      DayBook is 100% free for everyone. To maintain and continuously improve the service without charging subscription fees or locking features behind paywalls, we partner with reputable third-party advertising networks, including <strong>Google AdSense</strong>, to display non-intrusive advertisements.
    </p>
    <p>
      Our advertising partners use standard cookies to serve relevant ads based on web browsing behavior. However, your notes and task content are <strong>never</strong> analyzed or shared for advertising purposes. For complete details, please review our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Contact &amp; Leadership</h2>
    <p>
      DayBook is maintained with passion and dedication to humane software design. If you have any questions, feedback, or business inquiries, feel free to reach out directly:
    </p>
    <div class="contact-card">
      <p style="margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>Direct Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:work.sumritatiyagi@gmail.com">work.sumritatiyagi@gmail.com</a></p>
      <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Support Hours:</strong> Monday – Friday, 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM (IST)</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
